WEBVTT

00:11:28.339 --> 00:11:30.430
so se pojavili mnogocelični organizmi.

00:11:30.454 --> 00:11:32.955
Imamo gobe, imamo ribe,

00:11:32.979 --> 00:11:34.494
imamo rastline,

00:11:34.518 --> 00:11:37.229
imamo dvoživke, imamo plazilce,

00:11:37.253 --> 00:11:39.683
in potem, seveda, imamo dinozavre.

00:11:40.739 --> 00:11:43.248
In včasih se zgodijo katastrofe.

00:11:44.326 --> 00:11:46.715
Pred petinšestdesetimi milijoni let

00:11:46.739 --> 00:11:48.703
je na zemljo padel asteroid

00:11:48.727 --> 00:11:50.517
blizu polotoka Jukatan,

00:11:50.541 --> 00:11:53.509
kar je ustvarilo pogoje, enake tistim
v jedrski vojni,

00:11:53.533 --> 00:11:55.422
in dinozavri so bili izbrisani.

00:11:55.906 --> 00:11:58.976
Strašna novica za dinozavre,

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:02.755
a dobra za naše sesalske prednike,